# Overview

This document describes the implementation of **Phase 6 (AI Trip Planner)** and **Phase 7 (Map Integration)** of the TripMate project.

Phase 6 integrates **Google Gemini AI** to automatically generate structured travel itineraries based on trip details.

Phase 7 integrates **Geoapify APIs** with **Leaflet** to provide an interactive map, destination visualization, and nearby places such as hospitals, hotels, restaurants, petrol pumps, and tourist attractions.

