# Overall Summary

Phase 6 introduces an AI-powered itinerary generation system using the **Google Gemini API**. The generated itinerary includes day-wise planning, budget estimation, hotel recommendations, food suggestions, packing checklist, travel tips, and safety recommendations. The generated data is stored in MongoDB and can be regenerated whenever required.

Phase 7 enhances the user experience by integrating **Geoapify APIs** with **Leaflet** to provide an interactive map. Users can visualize trip destinations and search nearby hospitals, hotels, restaurants, petrol pumps, and tourist attractions. Dynamic markers, geolocation support, and real-time map rendering create a complete travel planning experience.

Together, these two phases combine Artificial Intelligence with real-world geospatial services, making TripMate an intelligent and interactive collaborative trip planning platform.

